###############################################################
### COUPON CALCULATION EXAMPLES
###############################################################

# Example 1: SAVE10 on ₹1000
# Discount Type: Percentage (10%)
# Order: ₹1000
# Discount: ₹1000 × 10/100 = ₹100
# Final: ₹1000 - ₹100 = ₹900

# Example 2: FLAT100 on ₹1500
# Discount Type: Fixed (₹100)
# Order: ₹1500
# Discount: ₹100
# Final: ₹1500 - ₹100 = ₹1400

# Example 3: SAVE20 on ₹3000 (max ₹500)
# Discount Type: Percentage (20%)
# Order: ₹3000
# Calculated: ₹3000 × 20/100 = ₹600
# Applied: ₹500 (capped at maximum)
# Final: ₹3000 - ₹500 = ₹2500

###
